  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Seminar on Sahel G5</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To ensure the protection of civilian&apos;s human rights in the Sahel region. The event will contribute to the coordination of efforts such as a) closer cooperation between civilian law enforcement agencies and the G5 Sahel Joint Force and b) civilian led training of the G5 Sahel Joint Force military and non-military personnel aimed at ensuring that the Joint Force will comply with international human rights law and respect the rights of civilian populations in relation to arrest, visitations, etc.</narrative>
  </description>
